        "title": "Single Line Diagram — 278 Modules & Microinverters, Three Phase",
        "discipline": "electrical_engineering",
        "date": "2024-03-25",
        "reading_notes": "Single-line electrical diagram for a 278-panel rooftop/ground-mount solar PV system at 28261 Turkey Run Road, Bloxom, VA 23308. Designer in title block: SOLAIR LLC (address/contact in right-side title column is present but small — partially legible, Virginia Beach area). Client/owner: Tai Dat, LLC per PDF title. System is three-phase, grid-tied with utility-owned transformer. 278 Hyperion GH108PB-400W modules (400W each) with 278 Enphase IQ8P-3P-72-E-US microinverters at 2.28 A each = 458.18A total AC. System DC capacity: 112.5 kW; AC capacity: 133.05 kW. Three sub-arrays feed three 'Solar Load Center Distribution Panel' units, each with a 10/3 copper feeder line and 4-gauge continuous copper ground. An 800A safety switch is shown between the sub-array outputs and the connection to the utility-owned transformer (labeled 'Next to Meter / Labeled Solar Disconnect'). String configs: 8 strings of 11 modules @ 18.13A each; 19 strings of 10 modules @ 18.48A each. General notes cover: grounding/bonding, permanently-marked circuit breaker, NEC compliance for distribution panels and switchboards, utility coordination for telephony/communications, revenue-grade meter, conduit requirements, and back-feed compliance. Utility account # 2880800; meter # 164368573. Note: No architectural/structural sheets present — electrical SLD only. No BOD, SOW, or contract documents present in intake folder."
